    "text": "Let F be a non-abelian free pro-p-group. Is it true that the subset {r ∈ F |\ncd (F/(r)) ⩽ 2} is dense in F ? Here (r) denotes the closed normal subgroup of F\ngenerated by r.                                                     O. V. Mel’nikov",
